{"id":"2e1e7d2159343e46","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence.md","title":"ZFC Seq Increasing Sequence","display":"df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence — ZFC Seq Increasing Sequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence"],"display":"df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence — ZFC Seq Increasing Sequence","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-seq-increasing-sequence — ZFC Seq Increasing Sequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,D,A,\\leq_A\\in V\">\\(s,D,A,\\leq_A\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_A\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(\\leq_A\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSeqIncreasingSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSeqIncreasingSequence}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}increasing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqIncreasingSequence}_S(s,D,A,\\leq_A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(D)\\land\\leq_A\\subseteq A\\times A\\land(\\forall x\\in A\\;(x\\leq_Ax))\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;((x\\leq_Ay\\land y\\leq_Az)\\to x\\leq_Az))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,D,A)\\land\\forall i,j\\in D\\;(i\\in j\\to s(i)\\leq_As(j))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}seq\\text{-}increasing\\text{-}sequence} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSeqIncreasingSequence}_S(s,D,A,\\leq_A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(D)\\land\\leq_A\\subseteq A\\times A\\land(\\forall x\\in A\\;(x\\leq_Ax))\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in A\\;((x\\leq_Ay\\land y\\leq_Az)\\to x\\leq_Az))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s,D,A)\\land\\forall i,j\\in D\\;(i\\in j\\to s(i)\\leq_As(j))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","